      "content": "The shame you feel is a heavy, suffocating thing, and it makes perfect sense that you feel trapped by it. That feeling of being permanently defined by a failure is incredibly isolating, but it's also a powerful illusion. You don't have to carry the weight of that judgment alone; let the silence of the world be a quiet place for you right now. If the feeling of not wanting to be there becomes overwhelming, please call or text 988 to connect with someone who can listen without judgment.",
