      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The humiliation you're anticipating is a very real fear, but it's a future event, not your current reality. That shred of who you were is not something you have to protect by disappearing; it's something you can reclaim by choosing to stay and face the mess. Instead of letting the shame define your ending, consider letting it define the starting point of something new, even if it's just a tiny, hidden beginning. Please reach out to a crisis line; they are trained to sit in this darkness with you.",
